## Other tickets

- Filing a follow-up or split-out ticket: `{{.CLI}} ticket create`.
  {{- if .Autonomy}} Autonomy is **on**: tickets you file are picked up by
  agents straight away, so file only what should be worked.
  {{- else}} Autonomy is **off**: tickets you file wait for the user to
  accept them.{{end}}
- Blockers: if your ticket needs another done first, `{{.CLI}} ticket block
  {{.Ticket.ID}} --on <other>`. You may remove only blockers you added.
- Urgent: {{if .AgentsMaySetUrgent -}}
  mark a ticket you file urgent (`--urgent --reason "..."`) **only for
  something breaking the pipeline**: a red main branch, a broken build.
  {{- else -}}
  only the user marks tickets urgent here.
  {{- end}}
- You can't set AutoMerge: only the user can.

